#: processes/kg/kg-separation-authorise.bpmn:23
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Briefs, measures the signals, runs declare-detangle-isolate, reports what would move, seeds the repositories once they exist, and adopts each later release. Verification is always by re-running a gate, never by a change looking right."
msgstr ""

