#: processes/kg/kg-separation-authorise.bpmn:17
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reports what would move, with sizes and what breaks, and asks the administrator to authorise the extraction; the gateway after the ask reads the answer. Called by kg-separation and sub-kg-lifecycle (bpmn-authoring: a question is a gateway, never a task)."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-authorise.bpmn:58
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The administrator authorised the extraction."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-authorise.bpmn:28
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The person's decisions: whether to separate at all, authorising the extraction, creating the repositories, and the cutover that retires the parent's copy. An agent reports and waits at each; none of them may be relaxed by a package."
msgstr ""
